      560.03,
      542.51,
      609.5
    ],
    "text": "The Foreign Exchange (Investment in the International Sovereign Bonds issued by the Government of Sri Lanka) Regulations No. 6 of 2021 issued under the Foreign Exchange Act, No. 12 of 2017 published in the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2234/20 of 30 June 2021 is hereby repealed and replaced with the following; without prejudice to anything done thereunder:",
    "fonts": [
