      84.01,
      620.03,
      542.48,
      657.5
    ],
    "text": "\u201cWhere any borrower under Regulations No. 6 of 2021 has no sufficient foreign exchange balances/cash flows, repayment of the loans obtained from overseas for the purpose of investing in International Sovereign Bonds and Sri Lanka Development Bonds is permitted by way of conversion of Sri Lanka Rupees\u201d.",
